  "schema:description": "Temperature profile data were collected using CTD casts in the South Atlantic Ocean from JAMES CLARK ROSS. Data were collected from 15 November 1996 to 20 November 1996. Data were submitted by British Oceanographic Data Center; Proudman Oceanographic Laboratory with support from the World Ocean Circulation Experiment (WOCE) project.\n\nPurpose: This dataset is available to the public for a wide variety of uses including scientific research and analysis.",
  "schema:creativeWorkStatus": "completed",
